      "description": "Use the historical caller bytecode for the SSE field, R2DBC constructor mapper and JMS recovery cases against published Spring 7.0.10. Run all nine histories with hash-locked artifacts and compare every event, mapped object, exception and provider action with the release receipt. Record compiled-class hashes in canonical order. Also repeat the retained WebTestClient builder follow-up on both historical pins and on the same published release. Repeat the four HTTP routes with the annotated controller dispatched by a real DispatcherServlet, and check the final campaign audit.",
